</code></pre></div><h2 id="ipfs-diag-datastore-get"><a href="#ipfs-diag-datastore-get" class="header-anchor">#</a> ipfs diag datastore get</h2> <div class="language- extra-class"><pre class="language-text"><code>WARNING:   EXPERIMENTAL, command may change in future releases

